{{Quote|A mythical scythe previously carried by the [[Soul Reaper]]. It has been hallowed for human use.|Item}}
The '''Hallow Scythe''' is a {{Mythical}} [[sword]].

The Hallow Scythe provides high damage and combo potential, with a unique feature in dealing higher damage with the enemy's health proportion, making it a good option for PvP.

It is also very famous, as in the [[Second Sea]] when used with Portal {{Ability|Portal|C}} move to teleport to '[[Lava|Lava']] paired with  {{Ability|Hallow Scythe|Z}}, it drags players across, resulting in them instantly losing [[health]].

==Obtainment ==
The Hallow Scythe can be obtained with a 5% chance by defeating the [[Soul Reaper]].

